<title>UK: LGK plans $500 million five-year Eurobond -CSFB.</title>
<headline>LGK plans $500 million five-year Eurobond -CSFB.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Landesgirokasse Oeffentliche Bank &amp; Landesparkasse (LGK) plans to launch a $500 million five-year bond, CSFB said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Goldman Sachs is joint lead manager of the transaction.</p>
<p>The borrower is rated triple-A by both Moody's Investors Service and Standard and Poor's Corp.</p>
<p>--  London Newsroom +44 171 542 7718</p>
</text>
